# ---- Duplicate / workspace-only artefacts ----------------------------------
# These are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored "models/"
# would also match app/models/, which is required at runtime.
# The root-level models/ folder holds byte-identical duplicates of the runtime
# copies kept only for the offline ML workspace, so it is excluded to avoid
# ~26 MB of duplicated binaries in the repository.
/models/
/notebooks/
/Data-raw/
/Data_to_consider/
/References/
/TEST_Project/
/New Plant Diseases Dataset(Augmented)/

# app/models/ IS committed - the app cannot predict without it.

# ---- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db